{"id":"02f37a11ca2f55ac","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-maximal-agreement.md","title":"Δ₂ 目标的历史最大一致长度与限制","display":"df-maximal-agreement — Δ₂ 目标的历史最大一致长度与限制","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-maximal-agreement","aliases":["20-df-maximal-agreement"],"display":"df-maximal-agreement — Δ₂ 目标的历史最大一致长度与限制","chapter":"7","section":"7.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Equations (7.15)–(7.16)","source_printed_pages":[161],"source_pdf_pages":[195],"depends_on":["[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]","[[20-df-use]]","[[20-df-computable-approximation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-maximal-agreement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-maximal-agreement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-agreement — Δ₂ 目标的历史最大一致长度与限制"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Equations (7.15)–(7.16)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>195</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_s\">\\(A_s\\)</span> 为统一可计算递增有限集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(c:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为全可计算函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lim_s c(x,s)=\\chi_C(x)\">\\(\\lim_s c(x,s)=\\chi_C(x)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s=\\{x&lt;s:c(x,s)=1\\}\">\\(C_s=\\{x&lt;s:c(x,s)=1\\}\\)</span>。先用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_s,C_s)\">\\((A_s,C_s)\\)</span> 定义上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(e,s)\">\\(\\ell(e,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e0d85a730fd3a26\" href=\"?note=2e0d85a730fd3a26\" title=\"20-df-length-of-agreement\">20-df-length-of-agreement</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" href=\"?note=4b1f1864d7fb1f2e\" title=\"20-df-use\">20-df-use</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nm(e,s):=\\max_{t\\le s}\\ell(e,t),\\\\\nr_*(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le m(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nm(e,s):=\\max_{t\\le s}\\ell(e,t),\\\\\nr_*(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le m(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 随阶段单调不减；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_*\">\\(r_*\\)</span> 本身仍可能因 oracle 损伤而下降。目标位可以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leftrightarrow1\">\\(0\\leftrightarrow1\\)</span> 反复变化，故只用当前一致长度不足以继续保护旧计算；历史最大长度保留了这些已达到位置的保护义务。有限阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_s\">\\(C_s\\)</span> 只截断尚未用到的坐标，不影响每个固定位置的极限。</p>\n<p>来源：Equations (7.15)–(7.16)；印刷页 161；PDF 第 195 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-length-of-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-length-of-agreement]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-use]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-length-of-agreement","status":"resolved","id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-use","status":"resolved","id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-length-of-agreement]]；see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A_s","display":false},{"tex":"c:\\omega^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lim_s c(x,s)=\\chi_C(x)","display":false},{"tex":"C_s=\\{x<s:c(x,s)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(A_s,C_s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(e,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}agreement}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nm(e,s):=\\max_{t\\le s}\\ell(e,t),\\\\\nr_*(e,s):=\\max\\bigl(\\{u_e^{A_s}(x):x\\le m(e,s)\\land\\Phi_{e,s}^{A_s}(x)\\downarrow\\}\\cup\\{0\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"r_*","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leftrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"C_s","display":false}],"bytes":1669,"backlinks":[{"id":"9a23aa09d0333bb6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。"},{"id":"5152fdccfe1e0c8e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-df-injury-elements]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]。"},{"id":"38ffff953003d9fb","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-delta2-sequence]]；see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-thm-single-event-enumeration]]；see [[20-df-re]]。"},{"id":"11bbbd83a4b964cf","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-maximal-agreement]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-preservation]]；see [[20-lem-delta2-restraint-limit]]；see [[20-df-simple]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-296","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-maximal-agreement]] — 章 7；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-296","locatio